              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The origin of લાવવું (lāvvũ) is not settled. CDIAL lists a Gujarati lāvvũ only in the sense \"to apply\" (CDIAL 11004). For Hindi lānā, \"to bring\", it gives Sanskrit labhate, \"takes\", crossed with dadāti, \"gives\" (CDIAL 10948)."
